From 7158ed2d9fd92f26b24991d0287c4f5866b835c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ghajarvpn Build <build@ghajarvpn.local>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 11:38:48 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] fix(openvpn): gate UI on the real handshake and crash-proof
 the engine

The bridge showed CONNECTED from stale callbacks and flipped back to
ERROR when the dying previous process reported NOPROCESS; the engine
could kill the whole app on startOpenVPN failures and stopVPN crashed
into NPEs once management was gone. GhajarUiRules now owns the pure
AUTH_FAILED/NOPROCESS/TLS message mapping, the test flow requires the
management CONNECTED state, disconnect goes through a single
stopEngineNow path, and the service resets mManagement/mProcessThread
on session end so reconnects start clean.
